    "text": "By Mazie McNamara NonStop Local Digital Producer ,\n6 hours ago RICHLAND, Wash. - The Richland Dog Park will be closed Thursday, August 28 for routine maintenance. \"All areas of The Richland Dog Park, Paws-Ability Place, will be closed for maintenance and reopen on August 29,\" Richland Parks and Public Facilities wrote on social media. For more information on Richland Parks... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
